3. PROTECTED VRP RUNTIME
================================================================

The Protected VRP Runtime is a separate, proprietary
implementation associated with the VRP architecture.

Its protected implementation may include:

- private source code;
- proprietary runtime algorithms;
- execution admission mechanisms;
- internal authority coordination;
- synchronization and concurrency mechanisms;
- protected continuity logic;
- implementation-specific state management;
- internal transport selection mechanisms;
- optimization strategies;
- private security controls;
- unpublished implementation architecture;
- confidential engineering methods;
- proprietary deployment components.

This repository does not distribute, license, or authorize
access to those protected implementation assets.

No license is granted under this document to possess, use,
copy, modify, distribute, sublicense, commercially deploy,
or otherwise exploit the Protected VRP Runtime.

Any authorized access or use requires a separate written
agreement defining the applicable scope and rights.

